01:51:02.022 --> 01:51:03.256
I was bummed I couldn't get those.

01:51:03.256 --> 01:51:06.960
And the Doritos Cool Ranch
Lay's, unfortunately.

01:51:06.960 --> 01:51:08.862
Let's now talk about two exclusive flavors

01:51:08.862 --> 01:51:11.498
