01:52:48.294 --> 01:52:49.963
Not salt and pepper.

01:52:49.963 --> 01:52:51.397
Don't you dare say that.

01:52:53.900 --> 01:52:56.302
It's very nice. I should
buy these more often.

01:52:56.302 --> 01:52:58.505
I've never tried these
before. Very good job.

01:52:58.505 --> 01:53:00.573
OK, on to the next wafer-style chip.

01:53:00.573 --> 01:53:02.842
We have sun-dried chili.

01:53:02.842 --> 01:53:06.012
Mm! I love sun-dried anything.

01:53:06.012 --> 01:53:10.517
Beam that sun ray onto any
vegetable. I will eat it.

01:53:11.518 --> 01:53:13.319
Oh, damn.

01:53:14.687 --> 01:53:16.022
This is really good.

01:53:16.022 --> 01:53:17.524
They smashed it with this one.

01:53:18.558 --> 01:53:20.293
Got a proper kick as well.

01:53:20.293 --> 01:53:21.361
Ooh!

01:53:21.361 --> 01:53:22.328
It's really yum.

01:53:22.328 --> 01:53:25.298
And one of the most beautiful
sights you'll see in India

01:53:25.298 --> 01:53:28.768
