01:53:30.270 --> 01:53:33.506
Biryanis, curries, they
all use sun-dried chili.

01:53:33.506 --> 01:53:36.142
And this chip's packet really
has nailed this flavor.

01:53:37.143 --> 01:53:39.078
Maybe my favorite, kettle cooked.

01:53:39.078 --> 01:53:42.115
We already saw the
Flamin' Hot kettle cooked.

01:53:42.115 --> 01:53:43.683
These are thicker chip.

01:53:43.683 --> 01:53:45.285
