01:53:49.556 --> 01:53:50.723
It's like ...

01:53:50.723 --> 01:53:51.791
I love kettle chips.

01:53:51.791 --> 01:53:53.760
Sea salt, cracked pepper.

01:53:56.062 --> 01:53:56.963
These are so good.

01:53:58.998 --> 01:54:01.067
Mm. Yeah!

01:54:01.067 --> 01:54:02.769
It's like ...

01:54:02.769 --> 01:54:03.603
booyah!

01:54:03.603 --> 01:54:05.338
[grunts]

01:54:05.338 --> 01:54:07.073
Sea salt and vinegar.

01:54:07.073 --> 01:54:09.042
This ain't your pond salt.

01:54:09.042 --> 01:54:10.810
This ain't your lake salt.

01:54:10.810 --> 01:54:13.246
This certainly is not your fjord salt.

01:54:15.381 --> 01:54:16.816
Why is salt and vinegar so good?

01:54:16.816 --> 01:54:17.817
Attention, everyone,

01:54:17.817 --> 01:54:20.787
